<title>USA: Neopath says names William Scott CFO.</title>
<headline>Neopath says names William Scott CFO.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NeoPath Inc said Thursday William Scott had been named vice president and chief financial officer and will be nominated to the board of directors at the annual meeting in May.</p>
<p>Scott was formerly vice president and general manager at Boston Scientific Corp's Northwest Technology Center.</p>
